      "message": "Thank you Harald for initiating this spec. I left an initial comment about storing template config in untrusted project which I think needs to be addressed upfront.\n\nFor example the spec says that the \"get_file\" function is not supported, but can it be disabled? (e.g. to prevent leaking ~/.config/openstack/clouds.yaml from the launcher process)",
